[{"id":3826420025,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7kEok5","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111787#pullrequestreview-3826420025","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111787","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111787#pullrequestreview-3826420025"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111787"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-19T14:56:00Z","commit_id":null},{"id":4546878411,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDwPbyw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. I think this is a great start, but some changes will be needed to make sure this better matches user expectations.\n\nSome feedback:\n\n- When opening the editor, there is no resolution preset initially checked:\n\n<img width=\"376\" height=\"255\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44f2b2c7-b90e-47e6-b1de-1652ceb6ba3e\" />\n\nInstead, the Default preset should be checked by default.\n\n- With this PR, overrides set in the project settings are no longer obeyed when the resolution preset is set to Default:\n\n<img width=\"605\" height=\"104\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7ca3669-318d-4510-ad0e-ce1d6160c35e\" />\n\nInstead, it always uses the base window width/height defined in the project settings. This should be reverted to the previous behavior to match what happens when game embedding is disabled. The Default resolution text should also display the effective resolution that takes the override into account (if any).\n\n- The Samsung Galaxy S24 and S25 series presets have the exact same resolution. I suggest removing all Galaxy S24 entries to shorten the list.\n  - The same goes for the OnePlus 12 and 13; you can remove the OnePlus 12 from the presets.\n\n- I noticed Android devices don't have a safe area defined in their presets. Is that intended?\n\n- The orientation project setting is incorrectly followed. All settings other than **Landscape** will use portrait mode for resolution presets:\n\n<img width=\"968\" height=\"242\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ecd0072-0c66-41cf-8b30-c28de35f6b87\" />\n\nInstead, **Landscape**, **Reverse Landscape** and **Sensor Landscape** should use a landscape resolution.\n\n- Resolution presets have no effect if the **Stretch to Fit** scale mode is selected in game embedding.\n  - To allow for a smoother UX, I suggest automatically swapping back to **Keep Aspect Ratio** when selecting a preset. Also, when choosing **Stretch to Fit**, the previously selected preset should be unchecked in the list.\n\n- When choosing a preset, it enforces a maximum resolution and aspect ratio. It does not allow the viewport to render at a higher resolution than what's shown on screen, even when using the `viewport` stretch mode. This can result in different visuals than what you'll see on the target device due to the pixel count being different. Some shaders have resolution-dependent behavior, and of course, using the `disabled` stretch mode will also result in resolution-dependent visuals.\n\n<img width=\"494\" height=\"261\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd4fd4ae-03dd-4e16-9545-a10d40892db1\" />","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111787#pullrequestreview-4546878411","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111787","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111787#pullrequestreview-4546878411"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111787"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-22T18:13:07Z","commit_id":"c94ccf2833b0d21df8038a53c877d6f92266dd7a"},{"id":4569830882,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEGIV4g","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://a